<title>sweden: TENNIS-SWITZERLAND LEAD SWEDEN 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWITZERLAND LEAD SWEDEN 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LULEA, Sweden 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland led Sweden 1-0</p>
<p>after the opening singles in their Davis Cup world group first</p>
<p>round tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Marc Rosset beat Magnus Larsson 7-6 (7-3) 3-6 6-4 4-6 13-11</p>
</text>
